{
  "id": "clockins",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Clock-ins and clock-outs: attendance in one click",
  "lang": "en",
  "app_version": "preprod-2026-10-09",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080
  },
  "start": {
    "url": "https://app-pre-production.sloneek.com/app/dashboard-v2",
    "local_storage": {
      "local-translate": "en"
    },
    "timezone": "Europe/Lisbon"
  },
  "voice": {
    "provider": "external",
    "voice_id": "7jQ3jNk3Fcw65sWUmzun",
    "model_id": "eleven_v4"
  },
  "chapters": true,
  "interstitials": true,
  "thumbnail": {
    "shot": "s16",
    "title": "Clock-ins and clock-outs"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "narration": "A paper attendance book, and chasing down who came in when at the end of the month? Hi, I'm Maria from the Sloneek team, and today I'll show you clock-ins and clock-outs.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance a.widget-headline-link",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "part": 1,
      "part_title": "Introduction",
      "hold_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "narration": "People clock in and out with a single click, on the web or at an attendance terminal. And you get attendance that's ready to use for payroll.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance p-card:has(a.widget-headline-link)",
          "before_ms": 600
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance p-card:has(a.widget-headline-link)",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "narration": "I'll show you the setup, everyday clocking in, and the manager's view. You'll find the module in the left menu under Attendance.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/attendance-v2-overview\"]",
          "before_ms": 2500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/attendance-v2-overview\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "narration": "Let's start with the setup. At the bottom of the left menu, I click Attendance settings.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/attendance-v2-overview-settings\"]",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/attendance-v2-overview-settings\"]",
          "before_ms": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "h1:text-is(\"Attendance settings\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview-settings"
      },
      "part": 2,
      "part_title": "Setup"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "narration": "In the Changes section, you let people correct their own attendance. I recommend keeping approval by an attendance approver switched on.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "form > p-card:nth-of-type(1)",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "form > p-card:nth-of-type(1)",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview-settings/general"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "narration": "Closing timesheets makes sure approvers close the timesheet every month. Here, between the first and the fourth day of the following month.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "form > p-card:nth-of-type(2)",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "form > p-card:nth-of-type(2)",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview-settings/general"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "narration": "Automatic breaks add the lunch break based on working hours, so people don't have to clock it.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "form > p-card:nth-of-type(3)",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "form > p-card:nth-of-type(3)",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview-settings/general"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "narration": "The Events tab holds the departure types, such as lunch, a break, or a doctor's visit.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "p-tab:text-is(\"Events\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "button:text-is(\"Add event\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview-settings/departures"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "narration": "For each one, you decide whether it counts as work and where people see it, for example on the terminal or on a desktop.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "table thead",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "table thead",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview-settings/departures"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "narration": "If you have an attendance terminal, you add it in the Terminals tab. You assign card or chip numbers to people in Attendance cards.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "p-tab:text-is(\"Terminals\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "p-tab:text-is(\"Attendance cards\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "p-tab:text-is(\"Attendance cards\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview-settings/departures"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "narration": "Now for an ordinary day. You get to work in the morning and find the Attendance widget on your Dashboard.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_dashboard",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_dashboard",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance button:text-is(\"Clock in\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "part": 3,
      "part_title": "Clocking in and out"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "narration": "The widget shows whether you're at work, how much you've worked today, and your balance up to today.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance p-tag",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance p-card:has(a.widget-headline-link) .p-card-content > div.d-flex.flex-column.gap-2",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance p-tag",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "narration": "I click Clock in. Sloneek instantly saves the time you arrived.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance button:text-is(\"Clock in\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance p-tag:text-is(\"At work\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "narration": "The status has switched to At work, and the button has changed to Clock out. Your time is counted from this moment.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance p-tag:text-is(\"At work\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance slnk-attendance-v2-clock-in-out-button button",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance slnk-attendance-v2-clock-in-out-button button",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "narration": "You'll find the details in the Attendance module. I'll open it straight from the widget.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance a.widget-headline-link",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": ".timeline-row.selected",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "narration": "In the Me view, you see the whole month. Each day has a timeline: work in green, breaks in orange, and time off in grey.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": ".timeline-row.selected",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": ".timeline-row.selected",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "narration": "On the right is the day's detail: the daily goal, how much you've worked, the balance, and a list of segments.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-attendance-v2-daily-summary-card p-card",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-attendance-v2-daily-summary-card p-card",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "narration": "Below it is the month summary with the total balance, so you see right away whether you have overtime or are short of hours.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-attendance-v2-monthly-summary-card p-card",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-attendance-v2-monthly-summary-card p-card",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "narration": "Forgot to clock in? With the Add segment button, you can fill in the missing time, even after the fact.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-attendance-v2-daily-summary-card button:text-is(\"Add segment\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": ".p-dialog .p-dialog-title:text-is(\"Add segment\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "narration": "You choose the segment type and the time from and to. Your manager then approves the change. I'll close the dialog now.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": ".p-dialog p-select#segmentType",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "400"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": ".p-dialog input#startTime",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": ".p-dialog button:text-is(\"Cancel\")",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-attendance-v2-daily-summary-card p-card",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "narration": "When you leave, you click Clock out. The menu also offers interruptions, such as lunch, a break, or a doctor's visit.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-attendance-v2-overview-page slnk-attendance-v2-clock-in-out-button button",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1200"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": ".p-menu-overlay ul.p-menu-list",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": ".p-menu-overlay li[aria-label=\"End of shift\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "narration": "At the end of the day, I choose End of shift. The At work segment now has both a start and an end.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": ".p-menu-overlay li[aria-label=\"End of shift\"] a",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "3000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-attendance-v2-daily-summary-card-event:has(.event-at-work)",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-attendance-v2-overview-page button:text-is(\"Clock in\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/attendance-v2-overview"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "narration": "And how does a manager see it? In the Team view, they have their people's attendance listed one below the other.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "p-togglebutton:text-is(\"Team\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "p-multiselect",
        "url_contains": "view=team"
      },
      "part": 4,
      "part_title": "Manager's view"
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "narration": "An admin can pick any team; a manager only sees their own. In Filters, they can show, for example, only errors or approval requests.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "p-multiselect",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:text-is(\"Filters\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "900"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": ".p-popover form",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "press",
          "value": "Escape",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "p-togglebutton:text-is(\"Team\")",
        "url_contains": "view=team"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s25",
      "narration": "The manager finds requests to change attendance in Approvals.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/events/approvals\"]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/events/approvals\"]",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "a[href=\"/app/events/approvals/attendance\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/events/approvals"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s26",
      "narration": "In the Attendance tab, they see both the original and the new value, and approve or reject the change with one click.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "a[href=\"/app/events/approvals/attendance\"]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "table thead",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "table tbody tr:first-child",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "th:text-is(\"New value\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/events/approvals/attendance"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s27",
      "narration": "You'll find attendance data for payroll and checks in Custom reports, among the pre-made reports.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/custom-reports\"]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/custom-reports\"]",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "a[href=\"/app/custom-reports/569\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s28",
      "narration": "I'll open the Overview of clock-ins and clock-outs, with every clock-in and clock-out for the chosen period.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "a[href=\"/app/custom-reports/569\"]",
          "before_ms": 800
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "navigate",
          "value": "https://app-pre-production.sloneek.com/app/custom-reports/569"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "3000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "h1:text-is(\"Overview of clock-ins and clock-outs\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/569"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s29",
      "narration": "For each record, you see the start, the end, the duration, and how it was entered, such as web or terminal. You can export the report to Excel.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.header.attendance\"]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "button:text-is(\"Export\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.header.attendance\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/569"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s30",
      "narration": "And that's it. You now know how to set up attendance, clock in and out, and keep track of your whole team.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_dashboard",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_dashboard",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "3000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-dashboard-v2-attendance p-card:has(a.widget-headline-link)",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "part": 5,
      "part_title": "Wrap-up"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31",
      "narration": "A final tip: on the Dashboard, you'll also find the Team attendance widget. It shows each team member's balance up to today.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-dashboard-v2-team-attendance p-card",
          "before_ms": 600
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-dashboard-v2-team-attendance p-card",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s32",
      "narration": "If something doesn't work, check the Help Center. Less admin, more time for people. This is Sloneek.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-dashboard-v2-team-attendance p-card",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "hold_after_ms": 1500
    }
  ],
  "_explored": {
